    // Fuzz a bytes4 interface id. The universal property:
    // Reference C: supportsInterface(i) returns true for IERC165 and IAccessControl interface ids.
    // Mutant: returns false for IERC165 id; thus for some input (the IERC165 id) it differs.
    function testFuzz_property(bytes4 interfaceId) public {
        // keep domain wide; no restrictive assume so fuzzer can find the distinguishing input

        // call supportsInterface and record whether it returns (no revert) and the returned value
        bool ok;
        bool ret;
        try c.supportsInterface(interfaceId) returns (bool v) {
